### Health Check - Gateway
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Health Check - Order Service
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### Criar usuário (via Gateway)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "name": "Maria"
}

### Criar pedido (via Gateway) — vai disparar o evento na fila
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "15b04b9b-ddeb-4d71-b61d-77ac683839be",
  "total": 199.90,
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "Tênis",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 199.90
    }
  ]
}

### Testar idempotência - enviar evento duplicado
POST http://localhost:3002/test-duplicate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "f210bee0-f6cd-4320-8e6b-28894e888ff3"
}

### Criar usuário VIA GATEWAY (porta 3000!)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "via-gateway@teste.com",
  "name": "Teste Gateway"
}

### Criar usuário
POST http://localhost:3001/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@teste.com",
  "name": "Teste"
}

### Criar pedido (substitua o userId pelo ID retornado acima)
POST http://localhost:3001/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "f9aa55e7-2a46-4159-a9e4-d4db01dddceb",
  "total": 150.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "Camiseta",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 75.00
    }
  ]
}

### Health check (público, sem token)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Criar usuário (público, passa pelo rate limit)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste-limit@email.com",
  "name": "Teste"
}

### Rota protegida (SEM token — deve dar 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/protected/orders

### Rota protegida (COM token — deve passar)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/protected/orders
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIxMjMifQ.lPOKIyE8eForpYvYpkulqFNSHtq-TWn3bkOoAxqwQAg

### Listar pedidos do usuário
GET http://localhost:3001/users/COLE_O_ID_AQUI/orders